TP 503 错误。\n\n1. **应用层异常确认**：Elasticsearch 日志明确记录 `dependency unavailable` (事实 6)，且 Temp/DLF 跟踪显示 HTTP GET `/work` 始终返回 `status_code: 503` (事实 7, 8)。\n2. **Kubelet 判定结果**：由于探针路径 `/work` 持续收到 503，Kubelet 判定就绪探针失败 (事实 1)，导致容器虽运行 (`Running`) 但状态为 `NotReady` (事实 5)。\n3. **缺失环节**：日志中仅提及“dependency unavailable”，未明确具体是哪个上游服务或组件故障，该部分原因未确认。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.8m\n├─ 问题定位: 20.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 76.0s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc: 76.0s (Evidence 65.8s, RCA 9.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 13.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc**: pod-notready-probe-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 109.342, "metrics": {"run_id": "f0e6461bf3214fff", "mttr": {"value": "1.8m", "seconds": 109.35368251800537, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-notready-probe-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-notready-probe-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5,